msgid "Step value:"
msgstr "Schrittweert:"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:143
msgid "End and start value must be positive."
msgstr "Enn- un Startweert mööt positiv wesen."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:147
msgid ""
"End value must be greater than the start value or the step must be less than "
"'1'."
msgstr ""
"De Ennweert mutt grötter as de Startweert wesen, oder de Schritt mutt lütter "
"as \"1\" wesen."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:152
msgid "None of the Start, Stop or Step values may be equal to zero."
msgstr "Start-, Enn- oder Schrittweerten mööt nich \"0\" wesen."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:157
msgid "Step value must be different from 1"
msgstr "Schrittweert mutt nich \"1\" wesen"

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:161
msgid "Step is negative."
msgstr "Schritt is negativ."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:168
msgid ""
"The step value must be greater than zero; otherwise, the linear series is "
"infinite."
msgstr ""
"De Schrittweert mutt grötter as Null wesen, anners gifft dat en lineaar Reeg "
"ahn Enn."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:173
msgid ""
"If the start value is greater than the end value the step must be less than "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Startweert grötter as de Ennweert is, mutt de Schritt lütter as Null "
"wesen."

#: dialogs/SeriesDialog.cpp:178
msgid ""
"If the step is negative, the start value must be greater then the end value."
msgstr ""
"Wenn de Schritt negativ is, mutt de Startweert grötter as de Ennweert wesen."

